<section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>Researcher at the intersection of <em>experiment & computation.</em></h1><p class="page-lead">I work across experimental biosensing, nanomaterials and computational molecular science, with an interest in translating scientific questions into measurable and modelled systems.</p></section>
<section class="content-split"><div class="section-label">01 / PROFILE</div><div><p>I am developing an interdisciplinary research profile that connects laboratory experimentation with computational investigation. My work spans electrochemical biosensing, nanomaterial characterization, molecular modelling and biomedical applications.</p><p>I am particularly interested in research workflows where computation can guide experimental design, while experimental observations provide a meaningful test of computational models.</p></div></section>
